    },
    "A newer version of Dokumentum set this rule. It is kept unless you choose another match." : {
      "comment" : "Matching rule sheet: explanation of a mode written by a newer app version.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine neuere Version von Dokumentum hat diese Regel festgelegt. Sie bleibt erhalten, solange du keine andere Zuordnung wählst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account" : {
      "comment" : "Sync status detail: label of the iCloud account's state.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the dialog that names a new correspondent, document type or tag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Deadline" : {
      "comment" : "Info panel and the detail's due-date suggestion: gives the document a deadline (the suggested day, else 7 days from today).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frist hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After text recognition, Apple Intelligence suggests a title, correspondent, document type, tags and date. Suggestions only fill empty fields and never change what you entered." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, Suggestions footer: what the suggestions do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nach der Texterkennung schlägt Apple Intelligence Titel, Korrespondent, Dokumenttyp, Tags und Datum vor. Vorschläge füllen nur leere Felder und ändern nichts, was du eingegeben hast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Documents" : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar row, list title and Go menu item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle Dokumente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All words" : {
      "comment" : "Matching rule mode: every word occurs, in any order.",
